---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { adoptions } from '../../data/evidence-platform.mjs';
---
<BaseLayout title="Verified adoption registry" description="A permissioned registry of independently verifiable use of versioned AI Amigos methods and playbooks.">
  <div class="shell"><section class="hero reading"><p class="eyebrow">Adoption registry</p><h1>A download is not adoption.</h1><p class="lede">A record appears here only when an outside participant verifies the method version, scope, date, permission, and independently controlled evidence link.</p></section>
  {adoptions.length ? <div class="record-table"><table><thead><tr><th>Adopter</th><th>Method</th><th>Scope</th><th>Verification</th></tr></thead><tbody>{adoptions.map((item) => <tr><td>{item.adopterName}</td><td>{item.methodVersion}</td><td>{item.scope}</td><td><a href={item.externalVerificationUrl} rel="external">Outside record</a></td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div> : <section class="empty-evidence"><span class="status pending">0 verified adoptions</span><h2>The registry is deliberately empty.</h2><p>No logo, testimonial, page view, download, email, or private project has been recast as independent adoption.</p><div class="button-row"><a class="button" href="/contact/">Verify an implementation</a><a class="button secondary" href="/data-policy/">Read the publication rules</a></div></section>}
  <section class="split-section section-space"><div><h2>Acceptance gate</h2><ul class="check-list"><li>Outside participant identity is verified</li><li>Method or playbook version is known</li><li>Scope and date are bounded</li><li>Publication consent is recorded</li><li>Outside corroboration uses an issuer-controlled location</li></ul></div><div><h2>Never counted as adoption</h2><ul><li>Visits, downloads, copies, or exports</li><li>Generated examples or internal tests</li><li>Anonymous testimonials without verification</li><li>Private messages without publication consent</li><li>AI Amigos statements about itself</li></ul></div></section></div>
</BaseLayout>
